--
elide_cpp_returned_temporaries gives a function that returns a class with
a constructor or destructor a hidden result parameter.  References to the
function outside calls, such as its address stored in a table, kept the old
type and failed --validate-goto-model (CBMC's own abstract_environment.cpp,
cpp17_abstract_environment_tu).
